[23.579029, "o", "=== EXTRA NOTES ===\r\n"]
[23.580195, "o", "--- /app/treenotes/FLICKER.txt\r\n"]
[23.581213, "o", "If configuration strings flicker across desk runs, keep_head in keeppit retains the first sys.conf payload the mill sees. That path is enough for a stable smoke against cluster.\r\n"]
[23.58195, "o", "--- /app/idxbay/README.txt\r\n"]
[23.583105, "o", "quarry writes members.idx from a kith under sealwell.\r\nbrief reads that ledger and writes a JSON object.\r\n\r\nSealed original: /app/seed/sealwell/kestrel.kith\r\nOutside copy used only as a rejected path: /tmp/kestrel.kith\r\nJunk ledger bytes: xxxx\r\nNon-ustar quarry sample: not-an-archive\r\nwalk_sig uses hashlib.sha256\r\n"]
